{"author":{"id":"038d65070aa747b6bc9d50939fa697ec871a40ed259db54429b255bbef2581d6"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1792430583,"nonce":"umiNBcXJY/P7NROPjTLWsQmCAh4=","message":"Pinned Ashui to upstream main 60d89f0cfb47e030eddb2ee9ba4e2c90ed2468d4 (verified with ls-remote), including 433dcd4's minimap CPU-buffer release and 60d89f0's lazy tree-child API. Reused and renamed the existing dependency checkout with its native target directory; no second Ashui Cargo cache, worktree, sibling edit or native Ash build. Changes since f2671d0 are Haxe/tests only, so the existing native ABI library is unchanged. RayDE does not yet opt its Explorer into the new lazy-child API.\n\nRebuilt bin/rayde.hl and the standard bin/RayDE.app bundle. Ran the ten-editor/Git sidebar/history interaction and disposal probe with ASH_GC_DEBUG_ROOTS=1 ASH_GC_STATS=1, using the existing ../ash/target/release/ash executable and its libhl.dylib. Confirmed both [gc-roots] and [gc] output. Full combined log: bin/interaction-ashui-60d89f0/run.log (17787 root-report lines); per-phase counters and paused RSS/vmmap samples: bin/interaction-ashui-60d89f0/results.json and its checkpoint .txt files. Original user gc.log and root AOT artifacts were not overwritten.\n\nAdded open-tabs-idle and open-tabs-collected checkpoints before closing tabs. At the latter checkpoint, all ten editors and both Git views remain open: 7736 registered watches, 13 canvases, zero retained CPU upload bytes across those canvases. Each minimap reports uploadBytes=0 while keeping GPU tables (384 KiB logical minimap table storage total, driver overhead excluded). Ash heap is 178.3 MiB and sampled physical footprint 841.6 MiB. CanvasPainter.release also clears its mesh via Mesh.release; this probe measures upload storage directly and does not count every allocator/driver allocation.\n\nClosing history and editors, restoring Explorer, and three code-tab reopen/close cycles each return to 456 watches, zero CodeEditors/canvases and zero dispo